-- Fill in the robots that had hand-built product pages, so they become
-- ordinary products edited in Admin -> Products.
--
-- Gausium Phantas, Aventurier A1-Youth and T-Chef TC-E10A get the full
-- content of the pages reviewed on the preview: text, photos, the four key
-- figures, the feature sections and the spec table. The product page shows
-- them in the full-screen design because each has "Full-screen page" content
-- (page.showcase). Generated from the old data/modelPages.ts, so nothing was
-- retyped. The Thai text is a DRAFT for the Thai team.
--
-- Leaves alone: price ("Price on request" until set in Admin), visible, the
-- recommender facts (fit), the order and anything else. A1-Basic and the four
-- Pudu robots are not touched: they stay hidden until their photos and specs
-- arrive.
--
-- Safe to run before the new code is live: the rows stay hidden, so
-- findmyrobo.com doesn't change. Safe to re-run: it rewrites the same content.
-- If a row is missing (seed-lineup-robots.sql never ran) it is added, hidden.
--
-- Run in Supabase: SQL Editor -> New query -> paste -> Run. Nothing to edit.

begin;

with robots (id, sort_order, name, brand, category, variant, conditions, image_url,
        tagline, description, features, page) as (
